  "title": "Arrabbiata Sauce",
  "description": "Arrabbiata sauce is a spicy, Italian, tomato-based sauce for pasta. In this easy recipe — a sizeable jolt of crushed red pepper revs up the heat!",
  "authors": [
    "Ellen"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-03-06T10:52:51-05:00",
